# Web3Forms access key for the /contact form.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com (enter the address that should receive
# enquiries; the key arrives by email). Copy this file to .env.local and paste
# the key below, then restart the dev server.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means this value is inlined into the client bundle. That is how
# Web3Forms is designed to work: the access key is public and only routes mail
# to the address it was issued for. Turn on the spam controls in the Web3Forms
# dashboard rather than relying on the key being secret.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
